       安房方江書状差遣す
       <lb/>
       <pb corresp="#pageB1048" facs="https://eiichi.shibusawa.or.jp/denkishiryo-bekkan/api/images/iiif/74/full/max/0/default.jpg" n="B1048" source="#pageB1048"/>
       <lb/>
